## Title: Forever Guild
## Notes: Level up together with your guild: guildmates online, dungeon groups and meetups, builds and macros for your class, guild goals, wishlist and giveaways, professions, a guild wall, rares and help.|nAddon messages to your guild only. Nothing from combat.
